+// RewindBox (patch 0075): heartbeat-side diagnostics asked by the 765 test. Each S2A_RB_* switch is read once; '0' turns it off.
+//   S2A_RB_STORE_BENCH: the store emulation self-test was skipped at boot (a debugger was attached then) while all 27 heartbeats said "debugger attached 0":
